583 0 obj
<</ActualText(At Scotlands leading design agency, I worked with clients such as Scottish Government, Sustrans, Business Gateway and VisitScotland. \n\nCreated wireframes, prototypes, and conducted UX research.\nFacilitated workshops and stakeholder discussions.\nEnsur\
ed accessibility and usability compliance.\nConducted quality assurance and testing across platforms.\nWorked in Agile environments to deliver digital projects efficiently.)/K 9/P 611 0 R/Pg 1 0 R/S/Span>>
endobj
584 0 obj
<</ActualText(The Carbon Trust is a global environmental consultancy made up of over 400 sustainability experts, engineers and policy specialists. \n\nBegan as an intern for the Web Manager before taking on the role as the first in-house Design & Digital Coordinator.\n\
Managed CMS \(Umbraco\) and maintained microsites.\nDesigned print materials, online marketing content and HTML emails.\nAnalysed web performance and recommended improvements.)/K 10/P 612 0 R/Pg 1 0 R/S/Span>>
endobj
585 0 obj
<</ActualText(BBA Candidate in Design Management)/K 11/P 613 0 R/Pg 1 0 R/S/Span>>
endobj
